-- Starter EPS-TOPIK content: two questions for each of the sixteen subtasks,
-- so every link in the practice menu opens a working question and "Next
-- question" has somewhere to go.
--
-- The questions are written for Prepyo in the style of HRD Korea's published
-- tasks; none is copied from its books. Pictures are simple SVG drawings kept
-- as question assets, and listening items carry a script the browser reads in
-- a Korean voice until real recordings are uploaded. All of it can be replaced
-- from the admin question bank.

